# ── Dart / Flutter build artifacts (any subdir: app/, grid_app/, …) ──
**/.dart_tool/
**/build/
**/.flutter-plugins
**/.flutter-plugins-dependencies
**/.packages
**/.pub-cache/
**/generated_plugin_registrant.dart
**/GeneratedPluginRegistrant.*

# ── Android / Gradle ──
**/.gradle/
**/local.properties
# 本仓库为纯本地私有仓库,release keystore/key.properties 有意纳入 git 随仓库备份;
# 若将来给仓库加远端(尤其公开),必须先把它们移出 git 历史再推(见 grid_app/BUILD_NOTES.md)。

# ── iOS / macOS ──
**/Pods/
.DS_Store

# ── IDE ──
.idea/
**/*.iml
.vscode/

# ── Superpowers scratch: SDD ledger/briefs/review packages + brainstorm mockups ──
.superpowers/
